      },
      "message": "Initial list proposal for Zkt instruction.\n\nThis an intial proposal for which instructions should have\ndata-independent execution latency with Zkt.\n\nThis includes add/sub, mul, mulh, mhacc, shift, compare, merge,\nunzip, zip, ppair, pack.\n\nWe can add/remove instructions. This is just an initial proposal to\nstart discussion.",
